{"id":"da9ba3590d181c14","group":"58","path":"58/batch18/58-df-zfc-extender-index.md","title":"ZFC Extender Index","display":"df-zfc-extender-index — ZFC Extender Index","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-extender-index","aliases":["58-df-zfc-extender-index"],"display":"df-zfc-extender-index — ZFC Extender Index","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-extender-index"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-extender-index</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-extender-index — ZFC Extender Index"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E,\\nu\\in V\">\\(E,\\nu\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ExtenderIndex}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ExtenderIndex}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (本文件定义)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}extender\\text{-}index} \\vdash \\mathrm{ExtenderIndex}_S(E,\\nu)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Function}(E,\\operatorname{dom}(E),\\operatorname{ran}(E))\\land\\operatorname{dom}(E)\\subseteq[\\mathrm{Ord}]^{&lt;\\omega}\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\nu)\\land\\nu=\\sup\\bigcup\\{a\\in\\operatorname{dom}(E):E(a)\\neq\\varnothing\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}extender\\text{-}index} \\vdash \\mathrm{ExtenderIndex}_S(E,\\nu)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Function}(E,\\operatorname{dom}(E),\\operatorname{ran}(E))\\land\\operatorname{dom}(E)\\subseteq[\\mathrm{Ord}]^{&lt;\\omega}\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\nu)\\land\\nu=\\sup\\bigcup\\{a\\in\\operatorname{dom}(E):E(a)\\neq\\varnothing\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC definition.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> 的陪域改为其集合值域，避免不存在的集合函数类型 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{dom}(E)\\to V\">\\(\\operatorname{dom}(E)\\to V\\)</span>；有限序数索引仍由定义域约束。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"reso